<p>You can print a document face up.</p>
<p>Use this function with <span class="Term-Soft">Reverse Order Printing</span> 
 to output a printed document in page order. When printing on label paper, 
 this function prevents jamming as a result of the separator being taken 
 off.</p>
<p>If you use <span class="Term-Soft">Eject Face-up</span> with <span class="Term-Soft">Reverse 
 Order Printing</span>, print results are as follows:</p>
<p>This example uses a document with three pages printed.</p>
<p>Depending on the printer you are using, this function may not be available.</p>
